    "mood": "humbled",
    "body": "At 10:41 PM last Thursday OurSpace went down. It was a power strip. It was always going to be a power strip. I was under my bed with a flashlight for two hours. When I came back up there were 63 messages and not one of them was angry. Brittany had posted a bulletin that said 'if anyone sees todd tell him it's ok.' Patrick had written 'are you ok' eleven times (he didn't know I couldn't read them yet). Somebody drew a power strip with a face. Chad wrote GREAT HUSTLE TODD. Vinyl_witch lit a candle. Even Marcus offered to 'take over temporarily,' which is a no, but a kind no. I sat on the floor with the laptop in my lap and read all of it. I do IT support for a living and nobody has ever sent me a bulletin. Anyway. The power strip is labeled now. The label says DO NOT."
