    "mood": "dusty",
    "body": "ok so dads camcorder had a tape in it from b4 i got it. i figured it was blank. nope. its me. im like 3. im on a tricycle on the driveway n i fall off it 41 TIMES (i counted, it took the whole tape). every time i get up n get back on n dad is behind the camera going 'again. again. u got it.' he never says 'ur done' or 'be careful.' just again. bro. thats where i got it. i been falling off stuff 4 16 years n getting back up n i thought it was just me being stubborn but its like, a family thing. i watched it 5 times. i didnt tell dad. i just asked if i could keep the camcorder thru the winter n he said 'u can have it, mike.' he didnt even ask why. ok im not crying its the dust off the tape"
