    "body": "my sister dana asked me 2 teach her 2 ollie. i said ok, 3 weeks, maybe 4, it took me 8 MONTHS. i had the whole speech ready. step 1, foot on the tail. she did. she popped it. the board went up. she landed on it. rolled like 4 feet. looked at me like 'is that it.' bro. 4 SECONDS. 8 months of my life. she said 'its not that hard, u just have 2 not think.' i been thinking abt that sentence 4 days. i think its the truest thing anyone has ever said abt skating n i cant use it bc it came from a 12 yr old w/ a mouthful of braces. so heres the plan. i teach her the kickflip, she is better than me in a week, i film it on dads camcorder, n i become the proudest worst skater in dayton."
