    "body": "i have a tape out from the video store. it's finding nemo. i rented it in the spring. brad (he works there, he has a name tag) says it's now '$412 late.' i asked is that a lot. he said 'it's a number.' i can't bring it back. here's why. the part where the dad fish swims across the whole ocean to find his son. i cry every time. and when i bring it back someone else will rent it and they'll get to that part and i won't be there. i won't know if they cried. i want to be there when somebody cries at it. mom says that's not how video stores work. but brad let me watch it in the store last week on the little one by the door and he sat on the floor with me. he didn't say anything. at the dad fish part he said 'every time.' so i think it's ok. i think brad cries too. i'm going to bring it back in the spring. or after."
