    "mood": "official",
    "body": "someone named walt wrote me a letter on my wall. it said 'Dear Patrick' at the top. nobody has ever said 'dear' to me. it was three paragraphs. i read it three times and then three more because it was so nice. i wanted to write back but i didn't know how to end it. he put 'Regards.' what comes after that. i asked mom (she works at the post office, she sorts) and she said 'it's just how you end a letter, honey.' so i tried. 'Dear Walt, i am fine. dwayne is fine. mom is fine. the turkey is fine, probably. how are you. Rocks, Patrick.' i don't know if 'rocks' is right. he wrote back: 'Dear Patrick, Rocks is acceptable. I intend to use it myself. Regards, Walt.' i have three letters now. mom put them in a shoebox. it says PATRICK on the lid in her handwriting."
